cabal-version: 3.0
name: yuho
version: 1.0.0.0
build-type: Simple
license: Apache-2.0
license-file: LICENSE
synopsis: Experimental diagram-first legal modelling language and SDK
description:
  A diagram-first language and Haskell SDK for explicitly authored legal
  structures, case information and technical application traces, with bounded
  Singapore criminal-law research examples. Authoring and projection formats
  remain experimental; technical results are not judicial or evidential findings.
category: Language
maintainer: https://github.com/gongahkia/yuho/issues
homepage: https://github.com/gongahkia/yuho
bug-reports: https://github.com/gongahkia/yuho/issues
extra-doc-files:
